    <tags>network scanner ip arp lan wifi portable</tags>
    <summary>Network scanner for field techs. No install required, no telemetry.</summary>
    <description>Fast local network scanner for Windows. Discover devices on your LAN by IP, MAC, hostname, and vendor without needing admin tools or a subscription.

- ARP-based device discovery
- MAC vendor lookup
- Hostname resolution
- Single Windows EXE, no runtime install required
- GPLv3, local-only, no account, no telemetry
    </description>
    <releaseNotes>https://github.com/SteveTheKiller/KillerScan/releases/tag/vREPLACE_VERSION</releaseNotes>
  </metadata>
  <files>
    <file src="tools\**" target="tools" />
